    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is excited to present this beautifully maintained 2 bedroomed apartment to the market, ideally located on the first floor of this ever popular development. Situated adjacent to the iconic Phoenix Park and just a short walk from the vibrant Castleknock Village, this property offers both convenience and comfort. The apartment is in excellent condition, ready for you to move in and enjoy. It also includes the added benefit of a designated underground parking space, ensuring both safety and convenience for your vehicle.\n\nThis delightful apartment offers a thoughtful layout that maximizes space and functionality. Upon entering, you'll be greeted by a welcoming entrance hall with convenient storage. The open-plan living and dining area provides an ideal space for relaxation and entertaining, with windows offering views of the beautifully landscaped communal gardens. Adjacent to the living area is a generously sized kitchen with a good selection of floor and eye level presses. The apartment features two spacious double bedrooms. The main bedroom boasts a walk-in dressing room and a separate en-suite bathroom, adding a touch of luxury and privacy. The second double bedroom also offers ample space and comes with fitted wardrobes. Completing the accommodation is a family-sized bathroom, conveniently located off the hallway.\n\nFawn Lodge's location so close to Castleknock Village and the magnificent Phoenix Park ensure the best of convenience. Shopping, dining and leisure and recreational options abound. A host of sporting clubs, including Castleknock Tennis Club, Cricket, Polo, Horseback riding, GAA, Rugby and several Golf Clubs are located in the immediate vicinity. \nCity Centre which is well served by bus and train is 7KM, the IFSC is 8KM, Four Courts 6 KM, Dublin Airport is 16 KM, (15/20 minutes drive). Heuston Train Station and the Luas hub are 5KM. Easy access to the N3, M3 and M50 ensure all major destinations are within reach. All times and distances are approximate.\n\nOverall, this is a great opportunity to buy a charming apartment close to both Castleknock and the Phoenix Park, viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith hot-press and 2 storage closets. solid Oak timber flooring.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.3m x 4.75m\nGood size open plan living/dining room spanning the width of the property. Wall mounted electric fire, recessed lighting and solid Oak timber flooring. Open arch to the kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 3m x 2.6m\nFully fitted kitchen with a good range of floor and eye level presses finished with granite worktops. Integrated oven, gas hob and extractor fan, integraetd dishwasher and washing machine, fridge and freezer/ tiled flooring. Recessed lighting.\n\nMain Bedroom - 5.6m x 2.8m\nLarge double bedroom with recessed lighting.\n\nWalk in Dressing Room - 1.2m x 1.2m\nWalk in wardrobe/dressing room with fitted storage and fashion rails.\n\nEn-Suite - 2m x 1.7m\nFully tiled en-suite comprises a corner shower, wc and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.8m\nGood sized double bedroom with fitted wardrobes., recessed lighting.\n\nBathroom - 2m x 1.7m\nFamily size bathroom with bath (shower overhead), wc, wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Private gated development</li><li>Located adjacent to the Phoenix Park</li><li>Walking distance to Castleknock Village</li><li>Secure underground car parking space</li><li>2 Double bedrooms</li><li>Public transport 1min walk away (Dublin Bus)</li><li>Communal gardens and walking track </li><li>GFCH</ul>"
      },
